<title>UKRAINE: SOCCER-UKRAINE AND GERMANY DRAW 1-1 IN EUROPEAN UNDER-21 GAME.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UKRAINE AND GERMANY DRAW 1-1 IN EUROPEAN UNDER-21 GAME.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine and Germany drew 1-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in their European under-21 championship group</p>
<p>nine qualifying match in Kiev on Friday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ukraine - Yuri Seleznyov 43</p>
<p>Germany - Markus Schroth 62</p>
<p>Red card - Seleznyov 61.</p>
<p>   Standings   P  W  D  L  F   A  Pts</p>
<p> 1.Germany     5  4  1  0  10  2 13</p>
<p> 2.Ukraine     6  3  1  2  12  4 10</p>
<p> 3.Portugal    5  3  0  2  10  8  9</p>
<p> 4.Albania     4  1  0  3   5 13  3</p>
<p> 5.Armenia     4  0  0  4   5 15  0</p>
</text>
